's restaurants  Gus meets with Lydia and Peter Schuler  from magical electro-motive because  Schuler's worried about their business  arrangement Gus has to calm them down  and in that we learned that they know  each other from chill a with Mike's help  Jimmy is able to get Lalo bail they  hired people to pretend to be Lalo's  family and the family of the travel wire  victim is in the courtroom as well Jimmy  is thrown off when he sees them and we  can see that it makes things difficult  for him but he still pulls it off the  judge grants Lalo a seven million dollar  cash bond he says he can get that but  he's gonna need Jimmy to pick it up for  him out in the hall we see Jimmy  watching Fred's family Howard approaches  him he calls him out about the car and  the prostitutes he says Jimmy I'm sorry  you're in pain and that sets Jimmy off  he launches into a tirade that concludes  with him saying lightning bolts shoot  from my fingertips because of their new  honesty policy Jimmy tells Kim he's  going to pick up the bail money she  doesn't like it and she doesn't want him  to go and basically the only thing he  can tell her is that it won't be a  problem of course things don't go as  planned he gets ambushed by a group of  bandits that we later learn Juan bolsa  hired in an effort to protect Gus's  business stopping Jimmy would keep Lalo  in jail where he would be less of a  problem in boss's eyes he doesn't know  that Gus is trying to get him out so  he'll go back to Mexico where he can try  to assassinate him Mike was able to save  Jimmy from being killed but they end up  stranded in the desert when Jimmy's  esteem dies on them they take a brutal  hike through the desert but managed to  get to the money to the court and get  Lalo out of jail there's no cell  reception on their journey so Kim has  left to worry about why Jimmy didn't  make it home in desperation she goes to  see Lalo in jail which puts her on his  radar and he knows he can use that to  his advantage 